  "content": "\n\n# 音樂通知\n\n當遊戲中播放音樂時，會顯示包含曲目名稱、作者與專輯名稱的彈出通知。\n\n### **需要**：[Cloth Config API](https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config)  \n\n若遇到任何問題，歡迎前往 [GitHub](https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/issues) 開啟 Issue。\n\n# 📷 遊戲內截圖\n<div>\n    <table>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/legacy_toast_album.webp\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">「顯示專輯名稱」：true</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/toasts.png\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">不同的彈出通知設定</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/raw/1.21.8/img/modded1.png\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">支援模組內容（<a href=\"\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-music-discs>更多音樂唱片</a>）</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n       <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/raw/next/.github/assets/jukebox_home_tab.webp\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">使用唱片机選單隨時隨地播放任意音樂</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n# 🎀 通知樣式\n\n<div>\n    <table>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/legacy_toast.webp\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">一般彈出通知</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/action_bar.webp\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">動作列</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/compact.webp\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">緊湊型</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n# ⚙ 設定\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/config.png\">\n\n\n# 影片預覽\nhttps://youtu.be/HK2swFtPanA\n\n# 自訂設定\n若要為自訂音樂提供支援或修改現有曲目，你需要在自訂資源包內的 `musicnotification` 命名空間下新增一個名為 `musics.json` 的檔案。\n\nJSON Schema 可於此處取得：[DOCS.md](https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/blob/next-stonecutter/DOCS.md)\n若有其他問題，歡迎提交 Issue。\n\n# 貢獻者\n唱片圖示由 [carotteatomique](https://github.com/carotteatomique) 製作  \n模組圖示由 [akairoo](https://dribbble.com/akairoo) 製作  \n簡體中文翻譯由 [Chiloven945](https://github.com/Chiloven945) 提供",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
